The reference video lives in the refcache slug `macbook-pro-apple-ad`; each project starts at its sequence (referenceOffset = the instant of the sequence in the film).
FR : un motion par sequence du film Apple. Usage: python3 motion/reproductions/apple_macbook_pro.py [id ...]"""
